Subject: Reduce background rendering in Performance Mode
Upstream-base: 7a6bf165d9f1c5914181c079c7d4bfa7204f3509

Performance Mode is a host display setting, independent of the [gameplay]
tweak mask. It omits the crowd impostor pass and decorative world NPC draws.
Their simulation and updates continue; gameplay effects and weather are not
changed. The guarded hooks exist only in the opt-in native game module.

diff --git a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
index 1a1099f..fb3d557 100644
--- a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
+++ b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
@@ -88,5 +88,10 @@ bool mscharged_tweak_original_frame(void);
 unsigned long mscharged_tweak_frame_number(unsigned long renderedFrame);
 
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+bool mscharged_tweak_performance_mode(void);
+void mscharged_tweak_report_stadium(int stadium);
+#endif
+
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 }
 #endif
diff --git a/src/Game/Task/GameRenderTask.cpp b/src/Game/Task/GameRenderTask.cpp
index 0000000..0000000 100644
